{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0545D0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你怎么看Peace Walker最后的行动？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"我完美重现了她的思维。那正是她自己的判断。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"最优秀的共情大脑深思过去与未来，从整个地球的尺度思考后得出的结论……不是报复。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"只要明白这一点，我就满足了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"……也就是说，和平不需要威慑力？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"我没这么说。重要的是祈愿和平。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"面对名为“国家”的巨大怪物及其盘算，MSF也需要保护自己的力量。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"为了活下去，也需要现实的思考。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"但即便如此，也必须始终保有理想。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"如果因为理想与现实的落差而痛苦，最后连理想都失去了……那时，MSF也就到头了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""}]}